sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>Flutter/HarmonyOS/Web
    participant Nginx as Nginx :80/:443
    participant Security as Security<br/>Middleware
    participant Pipeline as Middleware Pipeline<br/>10 Global MW
    participant RateLimit as RateLimit<br/>Middleware
    participant Route as Route Dispatch
    participant Poster as PosterVerify
    participant JWT as JwtAuth
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Model as Model<br/>BaseModel
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.0
    participant Redis as Redis 7
    participant ES as ES 8
    participant Response as Response<br/>HashidsEncode

    Client->>Nginx: HTTP Request<br/>api.erik.xyz/api/v1/...
    Nginx->>Security: Forward Request

    rect rgb(255, 205, 210)
        Note over Security: Security Detection Phase
        Security->>Security: ① Content-Type Check
        Security->>Security: ② Body Size ≤ 10MB
        Security->>Security: ③ XSS Detection 13 Rules
        Security->>Security: ④ SQLi Detection 13 Rules
        Security->>Security: ⑤ CRLF Header Injection
        Security->>Security: ⑥ Path Traversal
    end

    alt Attack Detected
        Security-->>Client: 4xxxx Error Response
    end

    Security->>Pipeline: Security Passed

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Pipeline: Request Preprocessing Phase
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑦ Cors Response Headers
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑧ Platform Source Detection
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑨ GeoIp Region/Currency
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑩ Locale Language Setting
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑪ HashidsDecode ID Decoding
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: ⑫ VersionRoute API Version
    end

    Pipeline->>RateLimit: Rate Limit Check

    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over RateLimit: Token Bucket Rate Limiting
        RateLimit->>Redis: ZADD + ZREMRANGEBYSCORE<br/>Sliding Window Count
        Redis-->>RateLimit: Requests in Current Window
    end

    alt Limit Exceeded
        RateLimit-->>Client: 429 Retry-After
    end

    RateLimit->>Route: Passed

    Route->>Route: API-Version → Namespace<br/>Controller Matching

    alt Sensitive Ops Register/Order/Payment
        Route->>Poster: Human Verification
        Poster->>Redis: GET poster_token:{key}
        Redis-->>Poster: token
        alt Verification Failed
            Poster-->>Client: 40007 Verification Failed
        end
    end

    alt Auth-Required API
        Route->>JWT: Bearer Token
        JWT->>JWT: HS256 Signature + Expiry Check
        alt Token Invalid
            JWT-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
        JWT->>Controller: request→userId
    end

    Route->>Controller: Business Processing

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
        Note over Controller,ES: Business Logic Processing
        Controller->>Model: Invoke Model
        Model->>Model: Snowflake ID Generation
        Model->>Model: Encryptable Encrypt/Decrypt
        Model->>MySQL: Read/Write Operations
        MySQL-->>Model: Results
        Model->>ES: Search/Index
        ES-->>Model: Search Results
        Model-->>Controller: Business Data
    end

    Controller->>Response: Return Data

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
        Note over Response: Response Post-Processing
        Response->>Response: HashidsEncode ID Encoding
        Response->>Response: AES Encrypt Sensitive Fields
        Response->>Response: JSON {code, msg, data}
    end

    Response->>Nginx: HTTP Response
    Nginx->>Client: JSON + CORS Headers
